_message="ucm-config: cyan: Add speaker swap mode  Set speaker swap mode like veyron_minnie.  BUG=chromium:646037 TEST=cras_test_client --swap_left_right 8:1:1, then play left right channel testing video on youtube.  Signed-off-by: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Change-Id: Ibcc5d74169677bed6fcfda36ef42c44414472fae Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/385076 Reviewed-by: Dylan Reid &lt;dgreid@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="8" gerrit_number="385076" owner_email="cychiang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/third_party/adhd" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/adhd" ref="refs/changes/76/385076/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="8"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I25d758badb92cbca341e2bc0cf3ee50b6c2d7a74" commit="ec54d11ab1d14b6cec06eab0cf76e805b6d6b28e" commit_message="rf_graphyte: update the method of patching DUT SSH link IP.  Since the Graphyte loads the DUT config in different way, we need to update the patch method. Originally the DUT config is stored in a certain file. Now Graphyte will load the default DUT config file, and then override the config by &quot;dut_config&quot; field in the global config file. So now we simply update the global config file to change the DUT ssh link IP. Also add an unittest to test the functionality of PatchSSHLinkConfig.  BUG=none TEST=py/test/pytests/rf_graphyte/rf_graphyte_unittest.py  Change-Id: I25d758badb92cbca341e2bc0cf3ee50b6c2d7a74 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/384193 Commit-Ready: Chih-Yu Huang &lt;akahuang@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Chih-Yu Huang &lt;akahuang@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Joel Kitching &lt;kitching@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="1" gerrit_number="384193" owner_email="akahuang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/platform/factory" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/factory" ref="refs/changes/93/384193/3